# Easy Steps (`#how`) — frozen implementation

Do **not** modify this file unless the user explicitly asks for Easy Steps / `#how` changes.

## Architecture

- **Two independent DOM trees** — never merge into one responsive block:
  - `EasyStepsDesktopRow`: `hidden` + `bp840:flex`
  - `EasyStepsMobileStack`: `flex flex-col` + `bp840:hidden`

## Desktop (viewport ≥ 840px)

- Row height: `h-[240px]`, `bp1200:h-[272px]`
- Layout: 1 expanded (`flex-[4]`) + 2 collapsed (`w-max shrink-0`)
- **Collapsed**: digit **in document flow** (`StepDigit`, not `absolute`) so `w-max` width = digit + padding
- **Expanded**: `StepDigitWatermark` with `absolute inset-[20px_30px]` + `flex items-end justify-end`
- Digit size: CSS var `--easy-step-digit-desktop` on `<section>` (not Tailwind `text-[calc(...)]`)
- Auto-rotate in viewport (~500ms delay, 2s interval); click sets `autoPlay = false` and stops interval
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: no interval

## Mobile (viewport ≤ 839px)

- Three cards, always expanded, full width, `gap-10`
- Card: text in flow first; digit overlay `absolute inset-0` + `items-end justify-end` + padding 30×20
- Digit size: `--easy-step-digit-mobile` + `min(..., calc((100cqw - 60px) / 0.85))` in `style` only
- **Do not** use unreliable `100cqh` with `@container` (inline-size)
- **Do not** apply `--easy-step-digit-desktop` on mobile cards

## Shared

- Padding: `px-[30px] py-[20px]`; gap between cards: `gap-10` (40px)
- Text: `text-left`
- Expanded watermark digit: `text-white/20`, bottom-right inside padding inset

## Anti-patterns (known regressions)

- `text-[calc(...)]` in Tailwind className
- `w-fit` + absolute-only digit on collapsed desktop (width → 0)
- Fixed `240×240` squares for collapsed cards
- Shared digit layer without `desktop` | `mobile` variant
- Fixing mobile by breaking desktop (or vice versa) in one shared code path
